 felicità.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Who should I trust?","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2020-10-16","status":"Released","rating":6.683,"ratingCount":109,"genres":["Dramma","Guerra","Thriller"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"114m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":84028,"name":"Yu Aoi","role":"Satoko Fukuhara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxZuHK0Be3caq3iTe03rbfzC5xB.jpg"},{"id":87662,"name":"Issey Takahashi","role":"Yūsaku Fukuhara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o5V869FSj4cCS0gnpHrlbX3xV9v.jpg"},{"id":1185386,"name":"Masahiro Higashide","role":"Yasuharu Tsumori","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6YOBIQ22Y7ZCkuk50QRotvUAl7v.jpg"},{"id":2167981,"name":"Ryota Bando","role":"Fumio Takeshita","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4UmfIDAvQsP8G9BdeWxBwmEq9wm.jpg"},{"id":1412420,"name":"Yuri Tsunematsu","role":"Komako","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qccqlyfX7Ki17vGUY0RdsLwVc7g.jpg"},{"id":1324449,"name":"Hyunri","role":"Hiroko Kusakabe","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u7st8OeVA4E1i20Q9PlN43Keeuf.jpg"},{"id":80865,"name":"Takashi Sasano","role":"Doctor Nozaki","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/172tux6gIAzCP1quDE0KqrUzNQL.jpg"},{"id":58616,"name":"Sakichi Sato","role":"Street vendor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1runpc2mcguDPdn7LTm2n06KISZ.jpg"},{"id":445710,"name":"Chuck Johnson","role":"Bob","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mKsI6pTJGiqclquqgTotRpj6fSa.jpg"},{"id":2059039,"name":"Maki Nishiyama","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vJrqvzP4NldHdlT5pKfuR58v5T5.jpg"},{"id":1602464,"name":"Minosuke","role":"Kanemura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cOecpuEbaebkL5bj4XkwdNknLmS.jpg"},{"id":3416385,"name":"Nihi","role":"Foreign Business Supplier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h0C37x2QlSvy8PebZRJJaeNke2e.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Moglie di una spia","overview":"È il 1940 a Kobe, la notte prima dello scoppio della Seconda guerra mondiale. Il mercante locale Yusaku Fukuhara sente che le cose stanno prendendo una brutta piega e decide di recarsi in Manciuria, senza portare con sé la moglie Satoko. Lì è casualmente testimone di un atto di barbarie e, determinato a renderlo pubblico, entra in azione. Nel frattempo, Satoko viene contattata da Taiji Tsumori, suo amico d’infanzia e membro della polizia militare, il quale le racconta della morte di una donna che suo marito ha riportato in Giappone dalla Manciuria. Satoko è accecata dalla gelosia e se la prende con Yusaku. Ma quando scopre le vere intenzioni del marito, fa una cosa impensabile per garantire la sua incolumità e la loro felicità."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Wife of a Spy","overview":"It’s 1940, and the population of Japan is divided over its entry into World War II. Satoko, the wife of a fabric merchant, is devoted to her husband but is beginning to suspect he’s up to something. Soon she allows herself to be drawn into a game in which she enigmatically conceals her intentions.","tagline":"Who should I trust?"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"映画監督・黒沢清が、主演に蒼井優を迎え、高精細8K撮影に挑む話題作！戦争という時代のうねりに翻弄されながらも、自らの信念と愛を貫く女性の姿を描くラブ・サスペンス。","tagline":"太平洋戦争前夜。時代の嵐が、二人の運命を変えていくー。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/orPfZOe77St05J3TrS9LkcZMiy4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sePlBkSsV4b43QXQXwZEmU5vp30.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":688301,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A3lmLpCmeYiZQMP4ZzlmrDDKeE8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A3lmLpCmeYiZQMP4ZzlmrDDKeE8